# Station (live server): room 1's manufacturing terminal at -43.4,40.6, from the user's recording of 2026-11-15
# (.work/e2e/202650-record, 143-165 s, its clicks as recorded): the terminal opens the manufacturing window (the
# client's MANUFACTURE_ITEM_CATAGORY); the category tree (each MANUFACTURE_ACTION) down to a leaf (its item list:
# MANUFACTURE_ITEM_CATAGORY), the item (MANUFACTURE_ITEM_ID): the server's MESSAGE_STRINGs name its components,
# each '(missing)', and 'Unable to create Vesta 4P. Missing required component(s).'; this character has none, so
# nothing is made and the cargo does not change (the user's manufacture of a Sculptor Major IPS 8 used parts this
# character no longer has). The close box; home.
name: starbase manufacturing: the category tree to an item and its components
timeout: 300
include _sb_home
walk-to -47,30
walk-to -44,38
face 8 tol 4
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 20
click 617,525 until antprox 'received MANUFACTURE_ITEM_CATAGORY' every 2 within 20
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 20
shot manu_open
# the category row: the computer (the root), then the '?' slot beside it ('Choose selection')
click 460,263
expect-event antprox 'received MANUFACTURE_ACTION' within 10
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 20
click 598,285
expect-event antprox 'received MANUFACTURE_ACTION' within 10
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 20
shot manu_level1
# the drill-down: the root's children (Items, Components) listed in the column below it (the user's gap 5 of
# 2026-11-21: ours left it empty, the categories' type test read a global of its own)
expect-ink manu_level1 520,400,140,60 300
# the root's two children (Items, Components) fill the column below it: Items; then its children (a column at
# x 684): the third (silver), then its first child (x 784), a leaf: its item list (MANUFACTURE_ITEM_CATAGORY)
click 569,428
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 20
click 661,641
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 20
click 784,416
expect-event antprox 'received MANUFACTURE_ITEM_CATAGORY' within 10
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 20
shot manu_list
# the list's one item, Vesta 4P (MANUFACTURE_ITEM_ID): the server names its components '(missing)'
click 465,409
expect-event antprox 'received MANUFACTURE_ITEM_ID' within 10
wait-event antprox 'sent MESSAGE_STRING' within 10
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 20
shot manu_item
# Manufacture (325,350, left of the window) stays disabled without the components: it sends nothing
click 858,221
expect-event antprox 'received MANUFACTURE_ACTION' within 10
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 20
walk-to -47,30
walk-to -48,5
